---
import Shot from "./Shot.astro";
---
<section class="grid items-center gap-10 pt-16 md:grid-cols-2 md:pt-24">
  <div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-text-strong md:text-5xl">
      A personal assistant that lives on your Mac. Only your Mac.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-prose text-lg leading-relaxed text-text">
      KonaClaw reads your calendar, your mail, and your notes, remembers what you tell it,
      and does the boring parts of your day. It runs on your own Apple-silicon Mac, so none
      of that ever leaves the room.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/download" class="rounded-lg bg-btn px-5 py-3 font-medium text-on-accent no-underline hover:opacity-90">Get notified at launch</a>
      <a href="/capabilities" class="rounded-lg border border-line-bright px-5 py-3 font-medium text-text no-underline hover:bg-panel">See everything it does</a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted-aa">Free trial at launch, then a paid license. macOS on Apple silicon.</p>
  </div>
  <Shot src="chat-week.png" alt="KonaClaw answering a question about the week ahead from the user's own calendar" priority />
</section>
